item.description:
What if the prophets already revealed how the Jewish exile would end?
In this eye-opening conversation, Rabbi Tovia Singer explores the prophecies of Leviticus, Deuteronomy, and Ezekiel, explaining why rising antisemitism, the return of the Jewish people to Israel, and today's world events may not be random at all. Could we be witnessing the final stages of exile and the beginning of the Messianic era?
@ToviaSinger1 #rabbitoviasinger #prophecy #endtimes

